{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:262","content":{"id":262,"title":"44 免疫系统与癌症","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b7b46906-3dc8-47f3-b217-e061b7782b9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"癌症是指某些部位的细胞不受控制地生长和增殖，可以分为两种："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"b1433ebd-b203-4b9b-a2b9-5d04bef0aec9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bbf740cb-0eb9-4b1e-bb23-f9a9039e74a9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e0a4e98a-8d9f-4915-aa65-a3735817714c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"发生于肺、肌肉、大脑、骨骼或性器官等实质性器官，形成肿瘤"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a529c4ad-3717-4758-8279-ca6aab8a95e6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"良性肿瘤不会像癌细胞侵犯其他组织和器官，局限在某个部位，甚至不用切除，除非长得太大，压迫大脑等器官。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"64761e73-13f4-46b6-a5f7-910272c0dc81","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"83d12f5e-e02d-48ca-ba52-a7ff121a58b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"非实体癌，起源于骨髓，会影响血液、骨髓、淋巴液、淋巴系统这些业务成分，这类癌症被统称为白血病，或者血癌"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"084222de-794f-480a-b89a-631b1a509b08","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基本上，所有的组织和细胞都有可能癌变，近 1/4 人会在一生中患癌，1/6 死于癌症。患癌最简单的办法就是活的足够久。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1deaeed9-af13-4a30-a3c8-61fd0dbd751d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"细胞要发展成癌症，必须发生突变，使得抑制癌症的三种机制都失效："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"f6fa7a99-fd16-453a-919f-3b7c411a4218","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f96f09a3-9aec-477a-a72a-52377fa522f0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a79a25cd-989b-4b90-ac77-0fe3bbde5b00","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"癌基因监控癌细胞的生长和增殖，在胚胎期时，癌基因表达就非常活跃，因为需要快速的分别和生长，当胚胎发育充分，能引发快速增殖的基因就会关闭。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aee1663f-4c95-4232-84f1-5212c74a52ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当几年后几十年后，某个突变重新开启这些癌基因时，细胞就会开始快速分裂增殖"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4c682950-9f90-4ae2-a6de-84564ac240e8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"df0070fc-acb6-4d9a-99e0-ead8227a7b85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"修复编码算上的基因，肿瘤抑制基因，这种基因会不停扫描 DNA，一旦发现异常和错误，就会修正，一旦发生突变，就失去了自我修复的能力"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"1b59e26f-6bf3-42b2-a8c6-f4a2c10a772d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"992ffafa-e68a-4b58-b0ab-2076fa6f9bae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"让细胞通过凋亡和有序自毁的基因，一旦失去自毁能力，错误就会累积下来"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"09481a54-34b0-4274-892b-986d43f8bf4a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当以上三种突变都发生时，就会引发癌变，这是癌症发病的基本原理。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f7d8472a-ca48-449f-a122-7170ab592d68","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"癌细胞不在和其他细胞合作，只会抢夺资源，不断分裂，夺走身体营养，破坏原本器官。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1578c13c-aa26-4ef0-a848-4757acf8c4fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"体内长出来的癌细胞，绝大部分会被不知不觉干掉。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dfceca65-5184-45a2-a890-bbd6d53ef63b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"免疫系统和癌细胞的较量，分为如下几个阶段："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"6a550801-bea2-4623-a2d6-2cbaf01ae7b1","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9ac626eb-83db-450c-a7c6-32387762d8ad","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dcc321c7-0297-4f4b-8a49-5ca628133f33","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"免疫清除阶段"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"522ecb11-2cf5-4639-9cdf-5085f754b50d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"体内有了癌细胞，癌细胞疯狂复制、增殖，需要更多的营养，引起周围健康细胞的死亡，细胞的非正常死亡引起免疫系统的注意，巨噬细胞和 NK 细胞来到现场，杀死癌细胞，并释放细胞因子，引起炎症，树突状细胞受到信号后激活为紧急状态，把癌细胞的样本送往辅助性 T 细胞和杀伤性 T 细胞，但是癌细胞原来也是体细胞，怎么识别出来是异物呢，因为癌细胞发生基因突变后，导致蛋白质异常，有些适应性细胞能和这些蛋白结合。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"39ce5ad8-7458-4f9e-b81d-8219a07b3644","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"T 细胞开始抑制血管的生长，饿死癌细胞，至少让肿瘤难以生长。杀伤性细胞会检查癌细胞体内情况，发现了异常的蛋白质就令其自毁，NK 细胞会杀死哪些隐藏了 MHC 分子的癌细胞。（癌细胞不是不能自毁吗？），巨噬细胞会清理癌细胞的尸体"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"43601f1b-9d38-429e-be83-ef805313218f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a578ac6c-2ffe-4e19-8428-55aada6d6617","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"平衡阶段"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f23e594a-dbae-4c15-99b2-f300ec4265df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"正常情况下肿瘤会被清除掉，但是如果发展不顺利，癌细胞会疯狂增殖，由于自我纠正机制损坏，因此突变发生的可能更大，就可能突变出那种善于躲藏，不被免疫系统发现的癌细胞。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1a417721-b28a-472b-aa5e-5cc1bed0f5f5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"癌细胞发生的这种突变，可以让杀手细胞失活，它通过干扰杀伤性 T 细胞和 NK 细胞上的抑制受体，从而抑制免疫细胞的杀戮。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"40bbd7a4-d507-4203-8962-f142f1b0bdaf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"新的肿瘤开始生长"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8c6f8adc-6831-42a9-912e-3ba79e0d35f4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d5d536db-84b5-47b0-87c6-d3d749a39b48","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"逃逸阶段"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"168c3a34-0a64-4ca2-95b1-0af47440829d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"经免疫锤炼的癌细胞，已经对免疫系统有了免疫力。随着肿瘤增长，又开始造成健康组织死亡，再次引起注意。癌细胞打造自己的世界，形成肿瘤微环境，让免疫细胞难以穿越。如果不做治疗，这些癌细胞将会有转移性，一旦扩展到肺、大脑或肝脏这些重要器官，人体这台机器就开始崩坏。"}]}]}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第四部分 反叛与内战"},{"label":"44 免疫系统与癌症","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:262","type":"doc","id":262}}],"prevPage":{"title":"43 免疫系统与应激","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:261","type":"doc","id":261}},"nextPage":{"title":"45 新冠病毒","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:263","type":"doc","id":263}},"createTime":1741916586707,"updateTime":1743303640538,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640538}}